.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK AUTH FORGET"
.SH NAME
hamstik auth forget \- Log out and forget a profile: remove its stored credential and its config entry (does not revoke the server\-side PAT)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik auth forget [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Log out and forget a profile: remove its stored credential and its config entry (does not revoke the server\-side PAT)
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I PROFILE
Profile to forget (defaults to the selected profile)
